{"type":"json_object","message":"The requested net change is the fiscal-year-end balance of unrecognized tax benefits at December 27, 2008 minus the fiscal-year-end balance at December 29, 2007. The 2007 year-end balance is the same as the 2008 beginning balance: $126.6 million (source:t1c1n0; also shown in the December 29, 2007 column as $126.6). The 2008 year-end balance is $214.4 million (source:t8c1n0). Both amounts are already in millions of U.S. dollars, so the subtraction is direct.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"end_2008 - end_2007","variables":{"end_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"end_2007":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t1c1n0","unit":"USD_million"}}}}